---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="TriCalculator — Calcola il tuo tempo di triathlon"
  description="Scopri in 30 secondi il tuo tempo stimato per Sprint, Olimpico, 70.3 e Ironman. Gratis, senza registrazione."
  canonicalUrl="https://tricalculator.app/start"
>
  <div class="start-page">

    <div class="start-hero">
      <div class="start-logo">
        <span class="start-tri">TRI</span><span class="start-calc">CALCULATOR</span>
      </div>

      <h1 class="start-headline">
        Scopri il tuo tempo<br/>al triathlon in 30 secondi.
      </h1>

      <p class="start-sub">
        Inserisci i tuoi dati di nuoto, bici e corsa.<br/>
        Il calcolatore stima i tuoi tempi su tutte le distanze — gratis, senza registrazione.
      </p>

      <a href="/#calculator" class="start-cta">
        Calcola i tuoi tempi →
      </a>

      <div class="start-distances">
        <div class="sd-item">
          <span class="sd-name">Sprint</span>
          <span class="sd-dist">750m · 20km · 5km</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sd-item">
          <span class="sd-name">Olimpico</span>
          <span class="sd-dist">1.5km · 40km · 10km</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sd-item">
          <span class="sd-name">70.3</span>
          <span class="sd-dist">1.9km · 90km · 21km</span>
        </div>
        <div class="sd-item">
          <span class="sd-name">Full IM</span>
          <span class="sd-dist">3.8km · 180km · 42km</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="start-features">
      <div class="sf-item">
        <div class="sf-icon">🏊</div>
        <div class="sf-text">
          <strong>Formula Riegel</strong>
          <span>Predizione tempi nuoto validata scientificamente</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sf-item">
        <div class="sf-icon">🚴</div>
        <div class="sf-text">
          <strong>Modello aerodinamico</strong>
          <span>Stima bici basata sui tuoi watt reali</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sf-item">
        <div class="sf-icon">🏃</div>
        <div class="sf-text">
          <strong>Fatica triathlon</strong>
          <span>Corsa calibrata sulla stanchezza accumulata</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sf-item">
        <div class="sf-icon">📊</div>
        <div class="sf-text">
          <strong>Zone + Taper</strong>
          <span>Zone Z1-Z5 e piano taper personalizzato</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sf-item">
        <div class="sf-icon">🍝</div>
        <div class="sf-text">
          <strong>Carb loading</strong>
          <span>Grammi di CHO personalizzati per distanza</span>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="sf-item">
        <div class="sf-icon">🗺️</div>
        <div class="sf-text">
          <strong>Analisi percorso GPX</strong>
          <span>Stima bici con correzione dislivello reale</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="start-final-cta">
      <a href="/#calculator" class="start-cta start-cta-lg">
        Inizia a calcolare — è gratis →
      </a>
      <p class="start-final-note">Nessun account. Nessun dato salvato. Solo calcoli.</p>
    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .start-page {
    max-width: 600px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .start-hero {
    padding: 3rem 0 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .start-logo {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 900;
    letter-spacing: -1px;
    line-height: 1;
  }

  .start-tri  { color: var(--color-primary); }
  .start-calc { color: var(--color-text); }

  .start-headline {
    font-size: clamp(1.9rem, 6vw, 2.8rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    line-height: 1.15;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .start-sub {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.65;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .start-cta {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-primary);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    padding: 16px 36px;
    border-radius: 50px;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: background 0.15s, transform 0.15s;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(229, 62, 62, 0.35);
  }

  .start-cta:hover {
    background: var(--color-primary-dark);
    transform: translateY(-2px);
  }

  .start-cta-lg {
    font-size: 1.1rem;
    padding: 18px 44px;
  }

  .start-distances {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 10px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 420px;
  }

  .sd-item {
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 12px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 3px;
  }

  .sd-name {
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    color: var(--color-primary);
  }

  .sd-dist {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Features */
  .start-features {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
    margin: 1rem 0 2.5rem;
    text-align: left;
  }

  .sf-item {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 12px;
    background: var(--color-surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
    padding: 14px;
  }

  .sf-icon { font-size: 1.4rem; flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1; }

  .sf-text {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2px;
  }

  .sf-text strong {
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-text);
  }

  .sf-text span {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    line-height: 1.4;
  }

  /* Final CTA */
  .start-final-cta {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.75rem;
  }

  .start-final-note {
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }
</style>
